---
import { policyDates } from '../data/legal';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
---

<ContentPage
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms that apply when you use InsureFacts, including that the content is general information only, how you may share it, and our limits of liability."
  lead="By using this website you agree to these terms. Please read them alongside our disclaimer."
  updated={policyDates.terms}
  ads={false}
>
  <h2>About these terms</h2>
  <p>
    These terms apply to your use of InsureFacts ({site.domain}), which is operated by{' '}
    {site.ownerName}, based in {site.ownerLocation} (“we”, “us”). If you don’t agree with them,
    please don’t use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Information only</h2>
  <p>
    The website provides general factual information about insurance. It is not financial, legal or
    insurance advice, and we don’t sell or arrange insurance. Our{' '}
    <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a> forms part of these terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Using our content</h2>
  <p>
    The text, design and logo on this website belong to {site.name} unless stated otherwise. You’re
    welcome to link to any page and to quote short extracts with a link back to the original page.
    You may not copy or republish whole articles, or present our content as your own, without our
    written permission. Content from official sources that we link to belongs to its owners.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>You agree not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>use the website in a way that breaks any law;</li>
    <li>try to disrupt, overload or gain unauthorised access to the website or its hosting;</li>
    <li>copy the website in bulk using automated tools in a way that harms its performance.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Links and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We link to other websites for reference and show ads served by Google AdSense. We aren’t
    responsible for the content of other websites or for advertisers’ products or services.
  </p>

  <h2>No guarantees</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep the website accurate and available, but it is provided “as is”. We don’t
    guarantee that it will always be available, error-free or up to date.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use
    of, or reliance on, this website. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits any liability, or
    any of your rights, that cannot be excluded or limited under the law that applies to you.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time. The “Last updated” date shows when they last
    changed.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the law of the place where InsureFacts is operated (
    {site.ownerLocation}), without affecting any rights you have under the consumer protection laws
    of the country where you live.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
